<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-01-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka's stock market was closed on Wednesday for a special New Year day holiday.</p>
<p>On Tuesday the all share index closed 0.36 points up at 602.96, on turnover of 59.31 milion rupees.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
